# =============================================================================
# 60-virtualization.list.chroot - KVM/QEMU and libvirt for the VM manager
# =============================================================================
# What: QEMU, libvirt with the default NAT network, virt-install tools,
#       UEFI firmware, software TPM, and noVNC with websockify for the
#       in-browser console.
# Why:  spec Tab B (runtime). swtpm-tools provides swtpm_setup, which libvirt
#       needs to create a TPM for the Windows preset.
# Format rules: see 10-base.list.chroot.
# =============================================================================

qemu-system-x86
qemu-utils
libvirt-daemon-system
libvirt-daemon-driver-qemu
libvirt-daemon-config-network
libvirt-clients
virtinst
ovmf
bridge-utils
swtpm
swtpm-tools
novnc
websockify
python3-websockify
